WEBVTT

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.640
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.300
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.140
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.970
To me, a savanna.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.310
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.310
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.650
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.320
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.650
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.990
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:43.490
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.160
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.660
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.330
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:53.170
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.510
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.010
It's just that I can't stand...

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.450
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.950
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:10.620
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.790
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:18.950
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:33.810
Hi, I'm Lina Inverse.

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.310
I came to the kingdom of Xoana
to see an ancient book of magic.

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:37.650
But, once we were there,
we were drawn into a plot...

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:43.150
... involving a Seyruun princess
taken hostage.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.490
And that princess was...

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:47.320
Oh, man! Amelia!
Long time, no see!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:52.160
On top of that, the king of Xoana
had hired Zelgadis to be his bodyguard!

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.500
Then some stuff happened and everything
went "boom!" by the end.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.830
A loud artillery salute to the rebirth
of the old Slayers team.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:00.340
Now we're all traveling again.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:04.110
Well, I wonder what's waiting for us.

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:10.350
"The Roguish Priest!
His Name is Xellos!"

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.610
Ah, what nice weather.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.120
Isn't it peaceful?

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.280
It feels so good!

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.290
If we had box lunches,
we could have a picnic.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.950
Yeah, exactly.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.790
But we are in the middle
of a journey...

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.120
...so don't start getting
too comfortable.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:28.800
Darn it, don't go to sleep, Gourry!

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.130
But we hardly ever get
a chance like this...

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.300
...so I want to stay
here a little longer.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.800
Right, Mr. Zelgadis?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.290
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.140
Jeez, he always has to
take off on his own!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.980
Hey, wait up a sec! Zel!

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:51.320
I told you I'm on a journey
to find the Claire Bible, but...

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.660
And I made it clear that this is
my own personal problem!

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.490
But even so...

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:01.420
Would you please stop following
and criticizing me?

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:03.930
Are you even listening to me?!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.440
lina

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.440
amelia

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:12.430
Either eat or talk.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:19.270
My bad. Please stop eating and talk.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.960
I said, even if you say that,
do you expect us to say...

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:33.460
..."Sure, whatever" like we're
strangers or something?!

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.630
You're being so distant,
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:39.130
And after we're all finally
reunited like this, too!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.800
We'll do whatever we can to help!

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.810
You all just consider me
your personal diversion.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.980
Aw, cut that out.
It's not like that!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.140
Right, Amelia?

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.810
Huh? Yeah! Of course not!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:55.980
Very well. I just ask that
you stay out of my way.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:01.090
Because I'm risking everything
on finding the Claire Bible...

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.590
...a mysterious book of sorcery
which supposedly contains...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.760
...the deepest secrets of the sorcery
and demons of the netherworld.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:11.600
And what will you do with it
when you find it?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.600
Now, look...

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.110
Zel wants to use the spells
in the Claire Bible...

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:23.110
...to turn himself from a chimera
back to a normal human!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.450
Huh? You still want to do that?!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.280
But you're so cool
the way you are now!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.950
Well, I don't like it!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.620
Look, considering
he says he hates it...

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.620
But why, Mr. Zelgadis?!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:38.290
Even if you look different,
our friendship is eternal!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.790
Besides that...

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.800
With friends like these...

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.300
Amelia! Can't you be
a little more subtle?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.470
How he has skin like a rock
and hair that's like wire!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.800
I never said that much!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.980
Besides, you should never
judge people by appearances!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.310
Enough... I'm going to bed.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.920
You...

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:04.090
Think we teased him
a little too much?

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.420
Huh? We were teasing him?

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.760
Mr. Zelgadis...

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.420
I wonder if his hair grows
back like ours does.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.100
The Claire Bible...

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:26.270
First, I'll have to gather
some info about it...

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:34.610
What the-?!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.630
Mercy! Mercy! Mercy!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:57.310
You're not getting away!

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.570
Flare Arrow!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:11.090
But I was asking for mercy!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:16.920
I figured I'd have to go out
to find this information!

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:20.260
Is the Claire Bible
among your stolen loot?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:23.260
Tell me about it right now!

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:28.270
Huh? Claire? What's that?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.760
Huh? Don't have it? Oh.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.600
Did I make a mistake?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.440
Well, I changed my mind.
So, who's next?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.410
Lina?

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.620
What's all the fuss?!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.620
Um, well...

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:50.630
The sound of bad guys getting beaten
is the jingle of money for me.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.460
Can't let up on those bandits...

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.800
...you know?

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:59.290
Miss Lina! Do you always do this?!

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.900
The Claire Bible...

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:06.740
I was looking for info
on the Claire Bible.

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:08.240
Okay, that's fine,
but are you gonna just...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.750
...shake down every bandit
in the world to find it?!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.080
Miss Lina...

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.420
You're doing this
for Mr. Zelgadis, aren't you?

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.420
Uh, no! No! No!
It's because I want it!

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.590
Understand? Don't make light...

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.260
...of the treasure and information
bandit gangs have!

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:25.760
It can be the most reliable
method of finding anything!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.430
My, my!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:33.270
That was fine deduction.
I'm quite impressed.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:36.940
To be expected of the infamous
bandit killer Lina Inverse.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:39.770
You've already realized that fact.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:49.120
So, it was worth my while
to secretly follow you all.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:52.450
I have a reason. I, too,
am looking for the Claire Bible.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.620
If you don't mind,
I was wondering if...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:58.790
...you might retrieve a manuscript of it
from a bandit gang I've been following.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.730
The Claire Bible?

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.560
A manuscript of it?!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.230
You...

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.230
Who are you?

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:20.750
Ah, have no worries.
I'm not someone to suspect.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:25.250
As you can see, I am Xellos,
the Mysterious Priest.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:26.240
Xellos?

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.260
Okay, I know he seems sorta
friendly at first glance...

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.760
...but what do you all make of him?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.760
Anyone who refers to himself
as "The Mysterious Priest"...

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.270
...gets a great,
big "suspicious" in my book!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.270
Yeah, exactly!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.440
Still, he did tell us about
the existence of the manuscript...

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.270
...so he may not be a bad guy.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.110
Now look...

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:49.770
We have no proof at all that
this manuscript is even real!

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:55.120
There's no need to worry
yourselves about that.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.450
The manuscript I'm after
was stolen...

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.950
...from a temple where
the Claire Bible...

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.390
...has been looked
after for generations.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:08.730
Okay, even saying that,
why are you after this stolen copy?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:12.070
Because I am a priest
of that temple.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.240
The honor of our temple
has been stained.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.070
I want to try and get it
back if I can.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.570
That's why I'm willing to
join forces with you to find it.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:23.580
Hmm... That does seem
to make sense...

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.570
So, telling a story like that
will make you believe me?

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.590
Did you just make all
of that up just now?!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.260
Look, Xellos, we're serious!
Quit fooling around!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.420
I don't mean to fool
around with anyone.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:37.930
That is the truth... basically.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.600
And I really do need you all
to help me with this.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.260
Well, then, what's the reason?

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.260
That's a secret.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.610
What?! What?!
What is with him?!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.610
Oh, this guy'd cheat everyone!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:00.620
Huh? Eat everyone?!
He doesn't seem that bad.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:01.950
Cheat, you idiot!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.950
Ridiculous.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:08.620
Considering that we now know
you're after what we're after...

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:11.460
...what idiot would be stupid
enough to help you out?!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.790
What if I said I'd let you
have the information...

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.800
...you need inside of the book,
Zelgadis?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.630
I don't trust you.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.790
My, my...

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.310
Why, you! What are you up to?!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.640
Whoa, whoa, Zel. I know
a lot happened to you...

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.310
...in the past to make
you doubt others, but...

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.810
She's right! Maybe it's a trick
or maybe it's a real chance!

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.820
I don't like to do things
this deliberately!

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.320
Then what should we do?

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.320
I said it before:

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.310
This is my own personal problem.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.000
Mr. Zelgadis...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.330
Ohh! He's going off on his own again!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.170
Okay, Xellos! The deal
is that we sneak into...

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:59.010
...the bandit gang's lair
and find the book, however!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.340
However?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:04.280
Our partnership lasts only until
you get the Claire Bible manuscript!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:08.450
After that, I make no guarantees!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.620
Very well.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:10.620
Okay, now that it's been decided...

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.290
...show us the way to
the bandit gang's hideout.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.460
I don't even know whether
this gang's called...

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.120
...the Dragon Fangs
or the Dragon Heads.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:21.630
Close! They're the Fighting Dragon's
Blood Macho Battlers!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:25.290
Macho... Oh, I have a really
bad feeling about this.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:46.820
Miss Lina! Miss Lina,
they look really dangerous!

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:49.490
Oh, we've come too far for you
to start complaining now!

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.320
Now, follow the plan, Amelia!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:57.000
Hi, there! Good work today, guys!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.670
I am the wandering
bounty hunter Lily!

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:00.940
And I'm her partner Gourin.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.100
We've come from another country
to be members of the...

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:05.770
...dragon's blood gang,
who are so famous in the underworld.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:07.940
So take us to your leader!

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.940
This girl is a princess of Seyruun.

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.280
A gift for you!
We hope you like her!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.270
Oh, please! Help!

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:20.290
Have you ever seen pecs
that flex so much?!

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.460
Oh, I wanna try that-

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.620
But I can't!

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.950
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:32.960
I... I'm scared...

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:39.470
Hey, Lina. You think
this is really working?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:43.810
Who knows? At least it's
gotten us inside, right?

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:47.980
Now we just have to ask the boss
if he has that priceless manuscript.

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:51.490
Then we choose the right moment
for Amelia to cause a diversion.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:55.490
And then we grab
the manuscript in the confusion.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:56.820
Bingo!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:13:00.430
You actually figured out the plan.
Good job, Gourry!

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.260
Now, then...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.590
Kinda big, isn't he?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.280
Come on, Lina! Ask him about
his priceless treasures!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.270
Well, yeah, but how do I do that?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.620
Lina, look! He did that
pec wiggling thing, too!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.290
All right, now's my turn-

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.450
I said I can't do that!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.970
What funny people.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.970
C'mon, there's nothin' to be afraid of.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:45.970
I'm pretty impressed that you
captured a Seyruun princess!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.140
Besides letting you join,
I'll give you something as a reward.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:52.980
It can be money or any treasure.
Say whatever you want!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.980
Oh, you actually talk.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.490
That'll sure make
the conversation go faster.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:14:01.760
Actually, I'd love to have your
copy of the Claire Bible.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:02.920
The manuscript?

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:05.930
If that's what you want,
then take it.

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:08.260
Take as much as you like!

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.770
Um, is the plan still working?

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:16.260
Of course not!
Our cover's blown!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:22.610
Exactly! I was tipped off that somebody
was sneaking in here to steal it!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.600
Get 'em guys!

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.780
Oh, for Pete's sake...
Let's get 'em!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.790
I wonder if Miss Lina's plan worked.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.450
I wonder if I should do it now.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:41.630
All right!

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:43.290
Flare...

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.120
What's happening?!

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.970
Fireball!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.920
What the-?! How can
they be so strong?!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.590
That guy didn't say
anything about this!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.750
I'm gettin' outta here!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.920
Hey! Wait! Gourry, take care of this!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:10.910
Sure!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.260
All right, time to really cut loose!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.260
Light, come forth!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.430
So, it's begun...

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.620
Ohh... Why'd it turn out like this?!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.620
Our plan's shot completely to hell!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.450
Oh, not at all!

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.290
Basically, this is all following
my plan perfectly.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.290
"Your" plan? Wait! Xellos!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.300
Hold it! What do you mean
this is following your plan?!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.630
Well, the truth is that I was
the one who tipped off...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:54.300
...the bandits about the people
coming to steal the manuscript.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.140
Y- you?!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.470
Never mind that.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.910
We're nearly to the manuscript.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.250
Cripes! You gotta be kidding!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.580
What's wrong with that girl?!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:14.760
Just lying to me like that!

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:19.090
After that, this is the one thing
I won't let her have!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.930
There, you see?

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:23.600
When people panic,
they always go...

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:26.930
...to grab their most
precious possessions.

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:29.770
So you caused this riot...

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.940
...just so he'd lead you
to the manuscript?

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.610
You were just using us
as pawns in your game!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.270
Pawns?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:40.940
Yes, I suppose so.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:46.790
To fool your enemies, you must first
be able to fool your friends.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:47.790
Right...

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.120
Right?!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.130
Quit fooling around!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.130
Well, shall we go?

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.790
Don't you ever listen
to other people?!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.070
Don't worry.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.900
I struck you with
the back of the sword.

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.080
Oh, sorry.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.250
This sword's double-bladed.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.580
Hey! Zel!

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:16.580
You were after that thing
from the start, weren't you?!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.920
You acted like you
were on your own...

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:20.590
...and then just followed us in!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.090
Nothing personal.

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:25.260
I never intended to
involve you in this.

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:26.930
Zel, wait!

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.600
My, my...

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.590
This is no good.

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:37.770
Now, then... No reason for me
to stay here any longer.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.640
You were helpful to me.

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.940
Don't take this personally, Lina.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.120
You...

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:56.450
Forgive me. You need to let me
check that out first.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.890
Damn!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.240
Damn you! Give that back to me!

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:14.900
I'll give it to you now,
once I know it's of no use to me.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.240
Flare Arrow!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.580
What?!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.590
Such an impetuous person!

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:28.590
Xellos, wait! You promised he'd get
the information he needs!

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:30.590
Come back down here!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.760
Never mind, Lina...

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:34.760
Nothing will stop me now...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.750
W- w- wait!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:41.770
Buday...

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.270
No, don't! Don't!

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:44.430
...Wind!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:13.570
Damn it! Don't I matter to you at all?!

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.400
As long as I have this...

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.080
No...

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.750
Oh, dear. It seems that
wasn't the manuscript...

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.920
...I'm looking for after all.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.920
I couldn't have you looking
at those troubling pages now...

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.250
...so I took the liberty
of destroying them.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.590
You what?!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:38.260
Oh, yes. Don't worry.
The information you want...

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:42.430
...wasn't in any of those pages.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.600
No... You think I can believe you?!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.940
Whether you believe me
or not is up to you.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:50.100
I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:52.770
And when we do, I'll have
another job for you all.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:56.270
Xellos... What are you really after?

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:00.110
That...

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.270
...is a secret.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.290
How could you?
Miss Lina, how could you?!

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.290
Forgetting about me like that!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:14.130
I get the feeling we're in
for some really bad times ahead.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:17.300
No kidding! Using me as his pawn...

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.130
That deserves a Dragon Slave!

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:21.300
I wonder who that guy really was.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.800
Anyway, I'm really impressed,
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.640
How did you manage to find
that secret hideout by yourself?

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:31.810
Really! He came flying in with
all his cool poses and stuff.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:34.980
But how did you manage
to find the manuscript?

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:39.490
Well, it was sort of...
You see...

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:41.660
Go on, tell us!

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.990
Well, you see, it's...

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.320
...a secret!

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:18.460
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:22.130
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:27.290
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:32.800
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:37.140
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:40.310
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:42.650
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:46.310
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:51.490
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:54.660
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.160
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:00.930
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:05.940
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:09.610
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:11.940
You only get one break in life...

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.610
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:14.950
... to your timid self!

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:17.280
It's all right!

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:25.290
Amelia, Zel! You have a lot
of nerve to stand up to me!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:26.960
You better watch to
see what happens next.

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:31.630
Next Episode is: "A Wonderful Business!
Being a Bodyguard Isn't Easy!"

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:34.290
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
